               ╭ Keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
               │                                                                                        │
               │ Ctrl+P            Command palette          Delete d          Delete                    │
               │ F5 Ctrl+E         Run statement/selection  Ctrl+S            Save                      │
               │ Shift+F5          Run the whole script     F1                Connection list           │
               │ Ctrl+Space        Suggest names            Ctrl+T            Next theme                │
               │ Ctrl+R            Query history            F12               Event log                 │
               │ Ctrl+N            New query tab            Space             Command menu              │
               │ Ctrl+W            Close query tab          ? F2              Show keys                 │
               │ Alt+] Ctrl+PgDn   Next query tab           Esc               Back / close              │
               │ Alt+[ Ctrl+PgUp   Previous query tab       q Ctrl+Q          Quit                      │
               │ Ctrl+C            Copy / cancel query      Enter             Select / new line         │
               │ y                 Copy as CSV, JSON, …     ↑                 Up                        │
               │ Ctrl+X            Cut                      ↓                 Down                      │
               │ Ctrl+V            Paste                    ←                 Left / previous column    │
               │ Ctrl+A            Select all               →                 Right / next column       │
               │ V                 Select whole rows        PgUp              Page up                   │
               │ Ctrl+Z            Undo                     PgDn              Page down                 │
               │ Ctrl+Y            Redo                     Home              First row / line start    │
               │ i                 Inspect / insert name    End               Last row / line end       │
               │ J                 Results as JSON / grid   Backspace         Delete back               │
               │ o                 Add a row                Alt+Backspace     Delete a word             │
               │ >                 Widen column             Alt+B Alt+←       Previous word             │
               │ <                 Narrow column            Alt+F Alt+→       Next word                 │
               │ Tab               Next panel               Shift+←           Select left               │
               │ Shift+Tab         Previous panel           Shift+→           Select right              │
               │ /                 Filter                   Shift+↑           Select up                 │
               │ R                 Refresh                  Shift+↓           Select down               │
               │ n                 New connection           Shift+Home        Select to line start      │
               │ e                 Edit / definition        Shift+End         Select to line end        │
               │                                                                                        │
               ╰─────────────────────────────────── any key to close ───────────────────────────────────╯
